1
00:01:43,539 --> 00:01:47,810
[KING OF COMEDY]

2
00:01:48,460 --> 00:01:50,900
[Episode 2]

3
00:01:52,150 --> 00:01:52,950
Farewell.

4
00:01:53,120 --> 00:01:54,380
Don't ever look for me.

5
00:01:54,400 --> 00:01:55,130
I'm leaving.

6
00:02:03,840 --> 00:02:04,900
I must be too tired.

7
00:02:07,920 --> 00:02:08,720
What's wrong?

8
00:02:09,630 --> 00:02:10,490
What happened?

9
00:02:11,120 --> 00:02:11,650
Brother!

10
00:02:11,700 --> 00:02:12,310
-Brother!
-Zhen.

11
00:02:12,310 --> 00:02:13,800
-What happened?
-There's a thief in our house!

12
00:02:13,800 --> 00:02:14,930
A thief in our house?

13
00:02:15,520 --> 00:02:16,360
A-Are you okay?

14
00:02:16,360 --> 00:02:17,360
I'm fine.

15
00:02:17,360 --> 00:02:18,470
W-What did the thief look like?

16
00:02:18,470 --> 00:02:19,150
He was short,

17
00:02:19,150 --> 00:02:19,750
wearing a suit,

18
00:02:19,750 --> 00:02:21,410
and he looked... he looked...

19
00:02:21,560 --> 00:02:23,290
Like a Sanxingdui bronze head?

20
00:02:24,320 --> 00:02:26,360
That's Mr. Zhou, the planner I hired.

21
00:02:26,360 --> 00:02:27,000
He left.

22
00:02:27,150 --> 00:02:27,780
He left?

23
00:02:28,400 --> 00:02:29,930
I already paid the deposit!

24
00:02:30,310 --> 00:02:31,510
You paid the deposit?

25
00:02:32,150 --> 00:02:32,710
Zhen!

26
00:02:34,960 --> 00:02:35,740
Don't run!

27
00:02:37,190 --> 00:02:37,960
Stop!

28
00:02:38,680 --> 00:02:39,800
Come back!

29
00:02:41,180 --> 00:02:43,910
How do I adjust
the height of this steering wheel?

30
00:02:51,710 --> 00:02:52,400
A ghost car?

31
00:03:01,050 --> 00:03:01,750
What was that?

32
00:03:01,750 --> 00:03:02,470
What is it?

33
00:03:03,240 --> 00:03:04,080
So scary.

34
00:03:04,360 --> 00:03:06,360
I told you this village was not good,

35
00:03:07,080 --> 00:03:08,610
but you insisted on coming.

36
00:03:08,930 --> 00:03:10,250
This slope...

37
00:03:16,440 --> 00:03:17,060
What?

38
00:03:17,750 --> 00:03:19,750
Do the villagers exercise at night?

39
00:03:19,960 --> 00:03:21,420
Could it be a female ghost?

40
00:03:24,400 --> 00:03:25,120
Move!

41
00:03:28,120 --> 00:03:28,750
Don't run!

42
00:03:29,800 --> 00:03:30,800
Stop!

43
00:03:31,560 --> 00:03:32,160
Help!

44
00:03:36,310 --> 00:03:37,120
Help!

45
00:03:51,190 --> 00:03:52,150
It's not like

46
00:03:52,740 --> 00:03:54,160
I'm going to eat you.

47
00:03:54,240 --> 00:03:55,640
Mr. Zhou, why did you run?

48
00:04:04,520 --> 00:04:06,240
I'll definitely try my best this time!

49
00:04:06,240 --> 00:04:07,300
Please forgive me!

50
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:09,130
I'll definitely...

51
00:04:09,910 --> 00:04:10,680
Mr. Zhou,

52
00:04:11,190 --> 00:04:12,280
come with me.

53
00:04:14,080 --> 00:04:16,610
Come with me...

54
00:04:17,730 --> 00:04:19,089
No! Please don't, miss!

55
00:04:19,120 --> 00:04:20,360
I'm not going! I'm not going!

56
00:04:20,360 --> 00:04:21,390
Miss, you go first! You go first!

57
00:04:21,390 --> 00:04:22,040
You go first!

58
00:04:22,040 --> 00:04:23,070
I'll go there sooner or later!

59
00:04:23,070 --> 00:04:24,390
I'll go there eventually!

60
00:04:24,390 --> 00:04:25,950
You can wait for me there, okay?

61
00:04:25,950 --> 00:04:27,750
I don't really want to go right now! I...

62
00:04:27,750 --> 00:04:28,750
Please.

63
00:04:28,750 --> 00:04:29,750
Then I'll wait for you.

64
00:04:29,750 --> 00:04:30,480
Wait for me! Wait for me!

65
00:04:30,480 --> 00:04:31,510
Just wait for me!

66
00:04:34,240 --> 00:04:34,700
Miss, I'll definitely

67
00:04:34,700 --> 00:04:35,480
try my best...

68
00:04:35,480 --> 00:04:36,070
Remember to come!

69
00:04:36,070 --> 00:04:36,920
I will!

70
00:04:37,240 --> 00:04:38,890
I'll work on it tonight!

71
00:04:38,920 --> 00:04:39,560
I'll make it grand for you!

72
00:04:39,560 --> 00:04:40,159
I'll wait for you.

73
00:04:40,159 --> 00:04:40,830
W-Wait for me!

74
00:04:40,830 --> 00:04:41,950
Wait for me to do it!

75
00:05:00,430 --> 00:05:03,000
[7 days left]

76
00:05:10,430 --> 00:05:11,030
Like this?

77
00:05:13,680 --> 00:05:14,390
Sister,

78
00:05:15,270 --> 00:05:17,480
what do you think of Mr. Zhou?

79
00:05:18,270 --> 00:05:19,270
I'm not sure.

80
00:05:19,830 --> 00:05:20,960
He seems a bit weird.

81
00:05:22,270 --> 00:05:23,440
I had a chat

82
00:05:24,630 --> 00:05:26,030
with Mr. Zhou yesterday.

83
00:05:27,480 --> 00:05:28,560
I think he's

84
00:05:30,950 --> 00:05:32,150
quite professional.

85
00:05:32,950 --> 00:05:35,800
But I'm still a bit worried.

86
00:05:39,770 --> 00:05:40,900
You don't trust him?

87
00:05:41,870 --> 00:05:42,950
I don't trust you.

88
00:05:45,210 --> 00:05:46,770
You don't trust me?

89
00:05:46,800 --> 00:05:47,680
-I do!
-Do you trust me or not?

90
00:05:47,680 --> 00:05:48,720
I trust you!

91
00:05:48,800 --> 00:05:49,159
I do.

92
00:05:49,600 --> 00:05:50,820
Go to the commissary and wake Mr. Zhou up.

93
00:05:50,820 --> 00:05:51,360
Okay.

94
00:05:55,390 --> 00:05:55,790
You...

95
00:05:56,370 --> 00:05:57,270
Slow down!

96
00:06:00,510 --> 00:06:01,120
Jiahao.

97
00:06:01,120 --> 00:06:01,720
You're up.

98
00:06:02,120 --> 00:06:03,450
Who were you talking to?

99
00:06:03,480 --> 00:06:05,210
I was just talking to my sister.

100
00:06:20,520 --> 00:06:22,120
Everything will be alright.

101
00:06:26,160 --> 00:06:27,220
Please take care of

102
00:06:27,240 --> 00:06:28,370
my sister's matter.

103
00:06:28,430 --> 00:06:30,030
We'll certainly do our best.

104
00:06:30,390 --> 00:06:31,680
Attention, everyone!

105
00:06:31,870 --> 00:06:33,130
Attention, everyone!

106
00:06:33,720 --> 00:06:35,390
Please come to
the village committee immediately.

107
00:06:35,390 --> 00:06:36,870
Mr. Gao from the Construction Group

108
00:06:36,870 --> 00:06:38,800
has something to tell us.

109
00:06:42,159 --> 00:06:42,830
Well,

110
00:06:42,830 --> 00:06:44,000
please be quiet!

111
00:06:45,630 --> 00:06:46,720
Villagers,

112
00:06:47,240 --> 00:06:49,000
we're lucky today.

113
00:06:49,680 --> 00:06:51,940
Let me formally introduce

114
00:06:52,190 --> 00:06:53,120
these two.

115
00:06:53,159 --> 00:06:56,630
This is Mr. Gao
from Ma Construction Group,

116
00:06:57,000 --> 00:06:58,480
Mr. Huang's

117
00:06:58,680 --> 00:06:59,480
secretary!

118
00:06:59,630 --> 00:07:00,000
Applause!

119
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:01,040
Okay!

120
00:07:01,630 --> 00:07:02,160
Great!

121
00:07:03,120 --> 00:07:03,600
Great!

122
00:07:04,360 --> 00:07:06,240
And the one next to him is

123
00:07:06,680 --> 00:07:10,070
Mr. Fei from Ma Construction Group,

124
00:07:10,070 --> 00:07:13,000
Mr. Gao's secretary!

125
00:07:14,070 --> 00:07:14,560
Applause!

126
00:07:14,560 --> 00:07:15,950
Great!

127
00:07:16,190 --> 00:07:17,000
Say hello.

128
00:07:19,560 --> 00:07:21,440
You fell asleep? Say hello!

129
00:07:21,920 --> 00:07:22,800
Hello, everyone!

130
00:07:22,800 --> 00:07:23,720
Hello!

131
00:07:23,870 --> 00:07:25,310
How did you fall asleep
at an occasion like this?

132
00:07:25,310 --> 00:07:27,240
Today, to thank everyone

133
00:07:27,240 --> 00:07:29,070
for supporting the demolition work,

134
00:07:29,070 --> 00:07:31,510
these two bosses

135
00:07:31,510 --> 00:07:32,970
have prepared some gifts.

136
00:07:33,120 --> 00:07:34,750
Everyone has a share.

137
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:36,430
So, let's line up and register.

138
00:07:36,430 --> 00:07:37,830
Everyone can get them, okay?

139
00:07:37,830 --> 00:07:38,310
Great!

140
00:07:38,310 --> 00:07:39,510
Come on!

141
00:07:39,510 --> 00:07:40,240
Line up!

142
00:07:40,600 --> 00:07:41,950
Maintain order!

143
00:07:42,240 --> 00:07:43,630
Register first!

144
00:07:43,750 --> 00:07:44,750
I'm Yang Chaoyue.

145
00:07:45,070 --> 00:07:45,870
Yang Chaoyue?

146
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:46,600
Yes, same name

147
00:07:46,600 --> 00:07:48,000
as the girl group member.

148
00:07:48,040 --> 00:07:49,040
That Chaoyue?

149
00:07:49,040 --> 00:07:50,100
Yes, that's right.

150
00:07:50,430 --> 00:07:51,120
Calm down.

151
00:07:51,120 --> 00:07:52,830
Everyone can get them.

152
00:07:52,830 --> 00:07:53,430
Qingxia!

153
00:07:53,430 --> 00:07:54,040
Auntie Qingxia.

154
00:07:54,040 --> 00:07:54,630
Ms. Qingxia.

155
00:07:54,630 --> 00:07:55,360
Chen Junnan.

156
00:07:56,560 --> 00:07:57,820
Zhen, why are you here?

157
00:07:58,000 --> 00:08:00,240
You said you'd give me 7 days,

158
00:08:00,360 --> 00:08:01,600
but now you're playing
these little tricks behind my back.

159
00:08:01,600 --> 00:08:02,470
What do you mean?

160
00:08:02,470 --> 00:08:03,510
This has nothing to do
with the demolition.

161
00:08:03,510 --> 00:08:05,160
We're just handing out gifts.

162
00:08:05,160 --> 00:08:06,960
Let's just proceed separately.

163
00:08:07,360 --> 00:08:09,560
I especially saved two baskets for you.

164
00:08:09,790 --> 00:08:10,360
Here.

165
00:08:10,360 --> 00:08:11,560
-I don't want them.
-Zhen.

166
00:08:11,560 --> 00:08:13,090
Take your dirty stuff away.

167
00:08:13,750 --> 00:08:15,550
Are you in trouble or something?

168
00:08:15,870 --> 00:08:17,240
Tell me. I can help you.

169
00:08:17,560 --> 00:08:18,240
No need.

170
00:08:18,480 --> 00:08:20,270
I've found a very capable planner,

171
00:08:20,270 --> 00:08:21,530
and he's at the commissary now.

172
00:08:21,530 --> 00:08:22,530
Just wait and see.

173
00:08:24,920 --> 00:08:25,830
A planner?

174
00:08:27,160 --> 00:08:28,490
They found one already?

175
00:08:40,870 --> 00:08:41,669
Mr. Zhou?

176
00:08:42,530 --> 00:08:43,590
Mr. Zhou?

177
00:08:44,550 --> 00:08:45,360
Mr. Zhou?

178
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:47,600
You can...

179
00:08:47,790 --> 00:08:49,120
come out during the day?

180
00:08:53,630 --> 00:08:54,910
Why can't I come out?

181
00:08:55,630 --> 00:08:57,000
Don't you need an umbrella

182
00:08:57,000 --> 00:08:58,660
to block the sun or something?

183
00:08:58,720 --> 00:09:00,360
We fishing people are used to the sun.

184
00:09:00,360 --> 00:09:00,910
It's fine.

185
00:09:00,910 --> 00:09:01,750
Impressive.

186
00:09:02,480 --> 00:09:03,200
Mr. Zhou,

187
00:09:03,200 --> 00:09:05,530
why did you decorate this place like this?

188
00:09:07,840 --> 00:09:08,480
Well,

189
00:09:09,200 --> 00:09:10,400
now that you're here,

190
00:09:10,550 --> 00:09:11,150
I...

191
00:09:11,270 --> 00:09:12,330
I'll report to you.

192
00:09:15,080 --> 00:09:16,030
Mr. Zhou, why are you...

193
00:09:16,030 --> 00:09:16,750
-You...
-Please don't.

194
00:09:16,750 --> 00:09:17,360
It's okay.

195
00:09:17,360 --> 00:09:18,760
I'll just talk like this.

196
00:09:19,510 --> 00:09:20,240
To be honest,

197
00:09:20,440 --> 00:09:21,670
I did

198
00:09:21,670 --> 00:09:23,510
make your ceremony a bit more traditional.

199
00:09:23,510 --> 00:09:25,080
But you came to me repeatedly last night,

200
00:09:25,080 --> 00:09:26,270
so you must've been dissatisfied with it.

201
00:09:26,270 --> 00:09:27,630
Therefore, I worked overnight
with the materials we had

202
00:09:27,630 --> 00:09:29,030
and made some creative changes.

203
00:09:29,030 --> 00:09:29,910
Let me show you.

204
00:09:31,200 --> 00:09:31,720
Please.

205
00:09:32,510 --> 00:09:33,870
When the ceremony begins,

206
00:09:33,870 --> 00:09:34,910
the attendees

207
00:09:34,910 --> 00:09:35,960
will walk this path

208
00:09:35,960 --> 00:09:36,750
all the way to the front,

209
00:09:36,750 --> 00:09:37,960
right here.

210
00:09:38,150 --> 00:09:40,280
It means walking the path of your life.

211
00:09:40,550 --> 00:09:41,600
Then they'll stop

212
00:09:42,200 --> 00:09:43,510
and bow three times.

213
00:09:43,510 --> 00:09:45,470
They'll put this paper boat in here,

214
00:09:45,470 --> 00:09:46,870
meaning "rest in peace."

215
00:09:47,480 --> 00:09:48,480
Rest in peace?

216
00:09:49,480 --> 00:09:49,960
Mr. Zhou,

217
00:09:49,960 --> 00:09:51,630
you mean a safe journey, right?

218
00:09:51,630 --> 00:09:52,830
Something like that.

219
00:09:53,080 --> 00:09:53,910
As for the music,

220
00:09:53,910 --> 00:09:55,000
I've prepared three options.

221
00:09:55,000 --> 00:09:56,480
This one is traditional,

222
00:09:56,600 --> 00:09:57,800
but the vibe is great.

223
00:09:58,240 --> 00:09:58,670
Of course,

224
00:09:58,670 --> 00:10:00,600
some people prefer festive music.

225
00:10:04,200 --> 00:10:05,860
And it goes with the lighting.

226
00:10:06,200 --> 00:10:06,750
I'm playing it

227
00:10:06,750 --> 00:10:08,440
at eight times the speed.

228
00:10:09,270 --> 00:10:10,200
And it sounds like this.

229
00:10:10,200 --> 00:10:10,600
Of course,

230
00:10:10,600 --> 00:10:12,360
young people like you
may prefer some stylish music,

231
00:10:12,360 --> 00:10:15,020
so I added some drumbeats
and electronic music.

232
00:10:17,720 --> 00:10:18,780
It'll be like this.

233
00:10:19,320 --> 00:10:20,750
This happy vibe.

234
00:10:20,750 --> 00:10:21,150
Well,

235
00:10:21,750 --> 00:10:22,960
as for the photo,

236
00:10:23,320 --> 00:10:24,480
I didn't know which one you'd like,

237
00:10:24,480 --> 00:10:25,720
so I downloaded them all

238
00:10:25,720 --> 00:10:26,670
from your brother's Moments

239
00:10:26,670 --> 00:10:27,840
and transferred them to the TV behind.

240
00:10:27,840 --> 00:10:29,700
Look, these are all photos of you.

241
00:10:31,150 --> 00:10:32,910
Look, you can choose the one you like.

242
00:10:32,910 --> 00:10:33,960
Oh, this is wrong.

243
00:10:33,960 --> 00:10:34,690
Not this one.

244
00:10:34,830 --> 00:10:35,830
All photos of you.

245
00:10:37,080 --> 00:10:38,720
Though we can make it

246
00:10:38,720 --> 00:10:39,910
stylish and creative,

247
00:10:39,910 --> 00:10:42,510
we still need elegiac couplets
at the funeral.

248
00:10:42,550 --> 00:10:44,750
So, I especially designed them for you.

249
00:10:45,550 --> 00:10:46,720
Zhen, you'll live in our memories forever.

250
00:10:46,720 --> 00:10:48,150
Please rest in peace.

251
00:10:48,270 --> 00:10:50,390
They're placed in front of
this giant pearl oyster.

252
00:10:50,390 --> 00:10:52,240
Although you're gone for good,

253
00:10:52,240 --> 00:10:54,170
just like the pearl in this oyster,

254
00:10:54,240 --> 00:10:56,000
you were a shining girl,

255
00:10:56,000 --> 00:10:58,530
and we'll always remember
your shining life.

256
00:11:07,150 --> 00:11:08,110
It's not "Potato."

257
00:11:08,110 --> 00:11:09,750
It's Mr. Maling.
(Sounds like "potato.")

258
00:11:09,750 --> 00:11:10,720
Potato?

259
00:11:11,270 --> 00:11:12,390
Mr. Maling.

260
00:11:12,670 --> 00:11:13,270
Potato?

261
00:11:13,270 --> 00:11:14,750
Write "Potato"!

262
00:11:14,750 --> 00:11:16,000
Wen, Wen.

263
00:11:16,030 --> 00:11:16,960
What's going on?

264
00:11:17,510 --> 00:11:19,390
The bosses from the Construction Group

265
00:11:19,390 --> 00:11:21,050
are giving gifts to everyone.

266
00:11:21,490 --> 00:11:22,840
Once they get the eggs,

267
00:11:22,870 --> 00:11:25,440
the demolition work will be much easier.

268
00:11:26,210 --> 00:11:27,120
If you want eggs, go line up.

269
00:11:27,120 --> 00:11:28,000
Wait.

270
00:11:28,000 --> 00:11:28,460
Line up.

271
00:11:29,790 --> 00:11:30,600
Wait.

272
00:11:30,910 --> 00:11:31,510
Hey!

273
00:11:31,720 --> 00:11:32,320
Well,

274
00:11:32,320 --> 00:11:33,120
everyone, wait a moment!

275
00:11:33,120 --> 00:11:34,200
Don't take the eggs!

276
00:11:34,200 --> 00:11:34,960
Listen to me!

277
00:11:35,480 --> 00:11:37,010
I have three points to make.

278
00:11:37,120 --> 00:11:38,840
This concerns everyone's interests.

279
00:11:38,840 --> 00:11:40,120
Everyone, listen to me.

280
00:11:40,120 --> 00:11:40,720
First,

281
00:11:41,080 --> 00:11:42,670
don't take these things.

282
00:11:43,030 --> 00:11:45,230
If you have taken them, return them now!

283
00:11:45,240 --> 00:11:46,150
Why?

284
00:11:46,150 --> 00:11:48,440
Why tell us not to take them
when it's my turn?

285
00:11:48,440 --> 00:11:50,770
Th-This is the second point
I want to make.

286
00:11:51,130 --> 00:11:54,000
We had a seven-day agreement
with the village chief.

287
00:11:54,000 --> 00:11:54,870
I've already hired

288
00:11:54,870 --> 00:11:56,510
an awesome planner,

289
00:11:56,510 --> 00:11:58,520
and he's in Shapu Village now.

290
00:11:58,670 --> 00:12:00,510
Once our video channel

291
00:12:00,510 --> 00:12:01,290
goes viral,

292
00:12:01,320 --> 00:12:03,380
we can promote our cultural tourism.

293
00:12:03,960 --> 00:12:04,910
That's right. Look,

294
