00:28:28,030 --> 00:28:29,560
You get eggs if you act well.

873
00:28:29,790 --> 00:28:30,930
What are you doing inside?

874
00:28:30,930 --> 00:28:31,730
Auditioning.

875
00:28:31,880 --> 00:28:33,140
None of your business.

876
00:28:34,310 --> 00:28:35,240
What a coincidence.

877
00:28:35,240 --> 00:28:36,550
W-We are here for the audition too.

878
00:28:36,550 --> 00:28:37,630
We're here for the audition.

879
00:28:37,630 --> 00:28:39,180
You like Zhen, don't you?

880
00:28:39,960 --> 00:28:41,400
Who would like you?

881
00:28:41,510 --> 00:28:42,550
You're a psycho.

882
00:28:42,720 --> 00:28:43,880
If nothing else, just leave.

883
00:28:43,880 --> 00:28:45,750
I want to audition. Why should I leave?

884
00:28:45,750 --> 00:28:47,310
Go line up at the back
if you want to audition.

885
00:28:47,310 --> 00:28:48,160
Line up?

886
00:28:48,160 --> 00:28:49,880
When have the villagers here
ever lined up?

887
00:28:49,880 --> 00:28:51,510
Let's see who dares to stop me.

888
00:28:51,510 --> 00:28:52,550
We're going to cut in line.

889
00:28:52,550 --> 00:28:53,270
We're going to cut in line.

890
00:28:53,270 --> 00:28:54,270
Don't...

891
00:28:54,270 --> 00:28:55,110
We're going to cut in line.

892
00:28:55,110 --> 00:28:55,570
Go away.

893
00:28:55,720 --> 00:28:56,250
Make way.

894
00:28:56,880 --> 00:28:57,400
What are you doing?

895
00:28:57,400 --> 00:28:58,300
The three little ones are here.

896
00:28:58,300 --> 00:28:59,360
What are you doing?

897
00:29:01,310 --> 00:29:02,000
Wait, you...

898
00:29:02,000 --> 00:29:03,530
What are you doing? Line up!

899
00:29:03,590 --> 00:29:04,270
Cut in line.

900
00:29:04,790 --> 00:29:06,200
Go, break in.

901
00:29:06,220 --> 00:29:07,270
I don't want to argue with them.

902
00:29:07,270 --> 00:29:08,930
You are just a bunch of losers.

903
00:29:09,400 --> 00:29:10,560
It's not going to work.

904
00:29:10,560 --> 00:29:12,110
Whoever acts is out of their mind.

905
00:29:12,110 --> 00:29:13,160
Just wait and see.

906
00:29:13,470 --> 00:29:14,800
Zhen will be mine.

907
00:29:18,830 --> 00:29:19,960
I'm a scientist.

908
00:29:20,110 --> 00:29:21,310
In the village,

909
00:29:21,590 --> 00:29:23,720
I help people repair home appliances.

910
00:29:23,880 --> 00:29:25,540
What have you prepared today?

911
00:29:26,270 --> 00:29:28,550
Actually, I've always wanted
to perform on the Spring Festival Gala.

912
00:29:28,550 --> 00:29:31,030
So, my talent is a small invention.

913
00:29:31,640 --> 00:29:32,170
I Hear You

914
00:29:33,350 --> 00:29:34,510
This is I Hear You.

915
00:29:35,740 --> 00:29:36,500
Mr. Zhou.

916
00:29:38,440 --> 00:29:38,900
This...

917
00:29:39,110 --> 00:29:41,640
Wear it near your heart.

918
00:29:45,960 --> 00:29:46,790
This thing

919
00:29:46,790 --> 00:29:48,640
can record your heartbeats.

920
00:29:48,830 --> 00:29:50,830
And I can use this Bluetooth headset

921
00:29:51,070 --> 00:29:53,130
to listen to your heartbeats at home.

922
00:29:54,030 --> 00:29:54,830
I can hear your sadness...

923
00:29:54,830 --> 00:29:55,440
This...

924
00:29:55,440 --> 00:29:56,440
And your anxiety.

925
00:29:56,470 --> 00:29:56,930
This...

926
00:29:57,180 --> 00:29:58,570
I can understand you better.

927
00:29:58,570 --> 00:29:59,110
So perverted.

928
00:29:59,110 --> 00:30:00,750
So it's I Hear You.

929
00:30:01,830 --> 00:30:03,290
It's a recorder, isn't it?

930
00:30:03,680 --> 00:30:04,480
A recorder.

931
00:30:04,550 --> 00:30:05,510
It's pretty good.

932
00:30:05,510 --> 00:30:07,880
♪ I want to know you better
in the village ♪

933
00:30:07,880 --> 00:30:10,200
♪ But we're further apart ♪

934
00:30:10,470 --> 00:30:13,070
♪ I really want to tell you ♪

935
00:30:13,100 --> 00:30:14,340
Okay, thank you.

936
00:30:14,400 --> 00:30:14,790
Mr. I Hear You.

937
00:30:14,790 --> 00:30:16,270
Look on the bright side, Mr. I Hear You.

938
00:30:16,270 --> 00:30:17,240
Okay, thanks.

939
00:30:17,550 --> 00:30:18,590
Thank you for hiring me.

940
00:30:18,590 --> 00:30:19,590
-We're not hiring you.
-Bye-bye.

941
00:30:19,590 --> 00:30:20,880
Fine. Goodbye.

942
00:30:20,880 --> 00:30:22,540
Should I give this back to you?

943
00:30:23,590 --> 00:30:24,590
Don't you want it?

944
00:30:25,110 --> 00:30:25,640
Bye-bye.

945
00:30:26,040 --> 00:30:27,300
Take care, Mr. Maling.

946
00:30:28,240 --> 00:30:29,480
Sir, go back and wait for our notice.

947
00:30:29,480 --> 00:30:30,510
Okay, thanks.

948
00:30:32,870 --> 00:30:33,420
Miss.

949
00:30:35,200 --> 00:30:35,920
Are you giving out eggs here?

950
00:30:35,920 --> 00:30:36,270
Yes.

951
00:30:36,480 --> 00:30:37,480
Can I get a box too?

952
00:30:37,550 --> 00:30:39,440
Sure, but you have to audition first.

953
00:30:39,440 --> 00:30:40,830
I'm not auditioning.

954
00:30:41,030 --> 00:30:42,240
I just want a box of eggs.

955
00:30:42,240 --> 00:30:43,920
You have to audition first.

956
00:30:43,920 --> 00:30:45,460
Otherwise, I can't give you eggs.

957
00:30:45,460 --> 00:30:46,640
What is this audition for?

958
00:30:46,640 --> 00:30:47,640
"King of Comedy."

959
00:30:48,240 --> 00:30:50,240
Sir, you don't look ordinary.

960
00:30:50,240 --> 00:30:51,310
How about I give you a number?

961
00:30:51,310 --> 00:30:52,440
You can audition too.

962
00:30:52,440 --> 00:30:53,550
"King of Comedy."

963
00:30:54,130 --> 00:30:55,460
That movie "King of Comedy"?

964
00:30:55,460 --> 00:30:55,960
Yes.

965
00:30:55,960 --> 00:30:57,890
There's no other "King of Comedy."

966
00:30:59,160 --> 00:31:00,750
They didn't do it right back then.

967
00:31:00,750 --> 00:31:02,050
Do you think you can?

968
00:31:02,600 --> 00:31:03,920
W-What do you mean?

969
00:31:07,440 --> 00:31:08,330
No one else?

970
00:31:08,510 --> 00:31:09,350
Nobody.

971
00:31:09,620 --> 00:31:10,100
No.

972
00:31:12,530 --> 00:31:13,010
Jiahao.

973
00:31:13,840 --> 00:31:16,800
Is this the final lineup of our village?

974
00:31:18,940 --> 00:31:20,770
There are quite a few to choose from.

975
00:31:20,770 --> 00:31:22,320
Look, the competition is fierce.

976
00:31:22,320 --> 00:31:25,480
Uncle Biao, Auntie Chaoyue,
Auntie Qingxia,

977
00:31:25,510 --> 00:31:26,490
-Haonan,
-Alright. They...

978
00:31:26,490 --> 00:31:27,720
and the one knocking the wooden fish.

979
00:31:27,720 --> 00:31:28,510
Well, I'm not...

980
00:31:28,510 --> 00:31:29,570
Ms. Zhen, Ms. Zhen.

981
00:31:29,720 --> 00:31:31,580
We want to hype up this village.

982
00:31:31,750 --> 00:31:32,920
We need to use the IP

983
00:31:32,920 --> 00:31:33,980
of "King of Comedy"

984
00:31:34,160 --> 00:31:35,110
to make something.

985
00:31:35,110 --> 00:31:37,310
But these have nothing to do with it.

986
00:31:39,700 --> 00:31:41,110
Is there no one else?

987
00:31:43,100 --> 00:31:44,850
An old man talked to me this afternoon...

988
00:31:44,850 --> 00:31:45,850
Alright. Enough.

989
00:31:46,600 --> 00:31:47,600
No more "old man."

990
00:31:47,860 --> 00:31:49,200
I'm a bit allergic to those words now.

991
00:31:49,200 --> 00:31:49,960
Sorry.

992
00:31:50,400 --> 00:31:52,870
Don't we have slightly younger
men and women

993
00:31:53,240 --> 00:31:55,040
who are easy to communicate with?

994
00:31:55,040 --> 00:31:56,550
As long as they look okay,

995
00:31:56,580 --> 00:31:57,510
I can train them.

996
00:31:58,200 --> 00:31:59,830
Yes, I have two friends from childhood.

997
00:31:59,830 --> 00:32:00,200
A man and a woman,

998
00:32:00,200 --> 00:32:01,100
and they're a couple.

999
00:32:01,100 --> 00:32:01,720
Isn't that perfect?

1000
00:32:01,720 --> 00:32:02,550
Why didn't they come today?

1001
00:32:02,550 --> 00:32:03,920
They went to the city
to deliver goods today.

1002
00:32:03,920 --> 00:32:05,550
Let's meet them tomorrow then.

1003
00:32:05,550 --> 00:32:06,710
It's just...

1004
00:32:08,050 --> 00:32:09,760
They...

1005
00:32:10,400 --> 00:32:12,030
How should I put it?

1006
00:32:13,010 --> 00:32:14,870
How about you meet them tomorrow?

1007
00:32:16,150 --> 00:32:17,730
Is it that hard to say?

1008
00:32:22,780 --> 00:32:23,980
[5 days left]

1009
00:32:32,960 --> 00:32:33,880
Itchy?

1010
00:32:35,440 --> 00:32:37,480
He's making me itch too.

1011
00:32:39,150 --> 00:32:40,210
Put your foot down.

1012
00:32:44,150 --> 00:32:44,630
Okay.

1013
00:32:44,830 --> 00:32:45,350
Please

1014
00:32:45,490 --> 00:32:46,820
introduce yourselves.

1015
00:32:48,510 --> 00:32:49,360
I'm Shengzai.

1016
00:32:49,640 --> 00:32:50,270
Shengzai.

1017
00:32:50,400 --> 00:32:51,270
I'm Yudan.

1018
00:32:51,680 --> 00:32:54,640
Do you have any expertise?

1019
00:32:55,880 --> 00:32:57,070
I can fish.

1020
00:32:57,440 --> 00:32:58,300
Anything else?

1021
00:32:58,510 --> 00:32:59,240
Dry the nets.

1022
00:33:00,220 --> 00:33:01,610
I fish for three days.

1023
00:33:02,530 --> 00:33:04,240
Yes, and dry the nets for two days.

1024
00:33:04,240 --> 00:33:05,160
Wait, well,

1025
00:33:05,440 --> 00:33:08,070
do you have any expertise
related to the arts?

1026
00:33:10,350 --> 00:33:11,480
Do you watch TV?

1027
00:33:11,880 --> 00:33:13,640
Yes, but seldom.

1028
00:33:14,260 --> 00:33:15,520
Do you listen to music?

1029
00:33:18,910 --> 00:33:20,190
At least you can talk.

1030
00:33:20,220 --> 00:33:21,830
Show us what you can do. Anything.

1031
00:33:21,830 --> 00:33:22,090
Yes.

1032
00:33:22,130 --> 00:33:24,220
That's right. Come on, let's do it.

1033
00:33:24,390 --> 00:33:26,030
Stop scratching. Scratch later.

1034
00:33:26,030 --> 00:33:26,920
What are you...

1035
00:33:27,870 --> 00:33:28,320
Okay.

1036
00:33:29,000 --> 00:33:30,050
You go first. You go first.

1037
00:33:30,050 --> 00:33:30,650
I go first?

1038
00:33:30,660 --> 00:33:31,390
You go first.

1039
00:33:42,260 --> 00:33:43,370
My true love

1040
00:33:44,000 --> 00:33:45,320
is a peerless hero.

1041
00:33:45,870 --> 00:33:48,830
One day, he'll come to pick me up
on a colorful cloud.

1042
00:33:51,160 --> 00:33:52,720
I guessed the beginning,

1043
00:33:55,290 --> 00:33:57,880
but I didn't guess the ending.

1044
00:34:04,400 --> 00:34:05,400
Think about it.

1045
00:34:06,160 --> 00:34:08,000
It's only been a few years
since Emperor Chongzhen, Zhu Youjian,

1046
00:34:08,000 --> 00:34:10,230
hanged himself on Jingshan Mountain!

1047
00:34:13,530 --> 00:34:15,130
And jazz.

1048
00:34:15,280 --> 00:34:16,920
You're gonna be my man.

1049
00:34:17,110 --> 00:34:18,760
My dance is so magical.

1050
00:34:19,350 --> 00:34:21,179
To be or not to be,

1051
00:34:23,929 --> 00:34:25,320
this is a question!

1052
00:34:25,550 --> 00:34:27,960
The net woven by worldly conventions...

1053
00:34:27,960 --> 00:34:29,480
That old crooked tree...

1054
00:34:29,480 --> 00:34:33,000
...wraps around me tightly like a viper!

1055
00:34:33,000 --> 00:34:34,460
...is watching you every day

1056
00:34:34,460 --> 00:34:36,210
right behind the palace!

1057
00:34:36,250 --> 00:34:38,460
I suffocate, I struggle,

1058
00:34:38,480 --> 00:34:40,000
I scream!

1059
00:34:40,030 --> 00:34:43,190
This isn't me!

1060
00:34:44,760 --> 00:34:46,510
It blows until stars scatter,
pits level, ice melts,

1061
00:34:46,510 --> 00:34:47,840
pines fall, eagles fly,
monks leave, lamps go out,

1062
00:34:47,840 --> 00:34:50,110
sutras mess up, nails drop,
and bows flip without stopping!

1063
00:34:50,110 --> 00:34:53,070
♪ Climbing up step by step ♪

1064
00:35:27,390 --> 00:35:30,030
Let's give a round of applause to them.

1065
00:35:36,180 --> 00:35:36,910
I'm excited.

1066
00:35:37,380 --> 00:35:39,310
Do you have any acting experience?

1067
00:35:40,420 --> 00:35:40,900
We...

1068
00:35:40,930 --> 00:35:41,990
He has experience.

1069
00:35:42,340 --> 00:35:43,280
A lot of experience.

1070
00:35:43,280 --> 00:35:43,850
Really?

1071
00:35:44,440 --> 00:35:45,440
He acts every day.

1072
00:35:45,940 --> 00:35:47,710
When he was chasing me,
he played a sweet guy during the day

1073
00:35:47,710 --> 00:35:49,310
and a heartbreaker at night.

1074
00:35:50,110 --> 00:35:51,400
Now that we're married,

1075
00:35:51,400 --> 00:35:52,190
he plays deaf during the day

1076
00:35:52,190 --> 00:35:53,520
and plays dead at night.

1077
00:35:53,840 --> 00:35:54,840
Not as good as you.

1078
00:35:55,360 --> 00:35:56,650
She's the best at playing gentle.

1079
00:35:56,650 --> 00:35:58,110
I was fooled by her acting.

1080
00:35:58,210 --> 00:35:59,210
Am I not gentle?

1081
00:35:59,240 --> 00:36:00,880
What gentle girl speaks so loudly?

1082
00:36:00,880 --> 00:36:02,320
Why do I speak loudly?

1083
00:36:02,320 --> 00:36:02,890
Why?

1084
00:36:02,920 --> 00:36:03,800
I'm a fishmonger.

1085
00:36:03,800 --> 00:36:05,890
How can I sell fish
if I don't speak loudly?

1086
00:36:05,890 --> 00:36:07,920
I fish for three days
and dry my nets for two days.

1087
00:36:07,920 --> 00:36:09,080
I work so hard!

1088
00:36:09,110 --> 00:36:10,670
So, I do nothing, right?

1089
00:36:10,670 --> 00:36:11,360
What do you do?

1090
00:36:11,360 --> 00:36:12,320
Who cooks at home,

1091
00:36:12,320 --> 00:36:13,030
mops the floor,

1092
00:36:13,030 --> 00:36:13,800
and wipes the table?

1093
00:36:13,800 --> 00:36:14,760
I wipe it!

1094
00:36:14,760 --> 00:36:16,480
But can you wipe it clean?

1095
00:36:16,480 --> 00:36:17,920
Don't I have to wipe it again
when I get home?

1096
00:36:17,920 --> 00:36:19,590
You have OCD. How can you blame me?

1097
00:36:19,590 --> 00:36:20,590
I have OCD?

1098
00:36:20,590 --> 00:36:21,360
Besides these things,

1099
00:36:21,360 --> 00:36:22,360
what else can you do? Tell me!

1100
00:36:22,360 --> 00:36:22,710
Enough.

1101
00:36:22,710 --> 00:36:24,150
I don't want to argue with you.

1102
00:36:24,150 --> 00:36:25,670
Don't you want a divorce? Let's do it!

1103
00:36:25,670 --> 00:36:26,230
I want a divorce.

1104
00:36:26,230 --> 00:36:27,550
-I wanted to divorce a long time ago!
-You want to, but you can't,

1105
00:36:27,550 --> 00:36:28,110
and that's the most painful!

1106
00:36:28,110 --> 00:36:28,880
I must divorce you!

1107
00:36:28,880 --> 00:36:30,840
No gentleness left,
only the farewell song.

1108
00:36:30,840 --> 00:36:31,480
What do you mean?

1109
00:36:31,480 --> 00:36:32,840
Why are you taking their poster?

1110
00:36:32,840 --> 00:36:34,230
Put it down, okay?

1111
00:36:34,410 --> 00:36:35,920
Don't take their salted fish.

1112
00:36:35,920 --> 00:36:36,920
There are so many dried fish at home.

1113
00:36:36,920 --> 00:36:37,960
Why are you stealing their salted fish?

1114
00:36:37,960 --> 00:36:38,810
You thief.

1115
00:36:38,970 --> 00:36:40,150
Why are you holding a racket?

1116
00:36:40,150 --> 00:36:41,410
Do you want to fight me?

1117
00:36:41,770 --> 00:36:42,760
What are you doing? Put it down!

1118
00:36:42,760 --> 00:36:43,230
I won't sit!

1119
00:36:43,230 --> 00:36:44,070
I'm telling you,

1120
00:36:44,070 --> 00:36:44,760
I love standing!

1121
00:36:44,760 --> 00:36:45,800
Stop!

1122
00:36:46,440 --> 00:36:47,400
Wait, don't fight!

1123
00:36:47,400 --> 00:36:48,110
Who told you to sit?

1124
00:36:48,110 --> 00:36:48,970
Don't fight because of us...

1125
00:36:48,970 --> 00:36:49,810
Don't worry.

1126
00:36:49,840 --> 00:36:51,000
They know what they're doing.

1127
00:36:51,000 --> 00:36:51,400
Shouldn't we stop them?

1128
00:36:51,400 --> 00:36:52,600
No need at all.

1129
00:36:52,630 --> 00:36:53,800
Three small arguments a day,

1130
00:36:53,800 --> 00:36:55,000
and a big argument every three days.

1131
00:36:55,000 --> 00:36:55,550
I'm used to it.

1132
00:36:55,550 --> 00:36:56,510
Shouldn't we stop them?

1133
00:36:56,510 --> 00:36:58,310
No need. This is normal for them.

1134
00:36:58,750 --> 00:36:59,840
See? I told you.

1135
00:37:00,230 --> 00:37:02,560
They are both fine when they are apart,

1136
00:37:02,590 --> 00:37:03,630
but they fight when they're together.

1137
00:37:03,630 --> 00:37:04,360
How is that going to work?

1138
00:37:04,360 --> 00:37:05,510
It's impossible.

1139
00:37:05,570 --> 00:37:06,100
Mr. Zhou,

1140
00:37:06,120 --> 00:37:07,260
how about we choose from the people
who auditioned yesterday...

1141
00:37:07,260 --> 00:37:08,030
Yes, just...

1142
00:37:08,800 --> 00:37:09,930
I've made up my mind.

1143
00:37:10,110 --> 00:37:11,880
I cherish talent. It has to be them.

1144
00:37:11,880 --> 00:37:13,230
Don't worry about their arguments.

1145
00:37:13,230 --> 00:37:13,960
Actors

1146
00:37:13,960 --> 00:37:15,590
hide behind their roles.

1147
00:37:15,720 --> 00:37:17,970
I believe they can play

1148
00:37:18,000 --> 00:37:19,110
their roles well.

1149
00:37:19,280 --> 00:37:20,080
It's settled.

1150
00:37:20,230 --> 00:37:22,030
Let's start filming right away.

1151
00:37:24,550 --> 00:37:24,920
Hey!

1152
00:37:27,110 --> 00:37:27,800
What?

1153
00:37:28,480 --> 00:37:29,210
You leaving?

1154
00:37:29,410 --> 00:37:30,010
Yes.

1155
00:37:31,120 --> 00:37:31,580
Where are you going?

1156
00:37:31,580 --> 00:37:32,240
Going home.

1157
00:37:33,070 --> 00:37:33,600
And then?

1158
00:37:34,110 --> 00:37:35,110
Going to work.

1159
00:37:36,950 --> 00:37:37,890
Could you just not go to work?

1160
00:37:37,890 --> 00:37:38,690
Not go to work?

1161
00:37:38,960 --> 00:37:40,960
How can I support you if I don't work?

1162
00:37:42,510 --> 00:37:43,370
It makes sense.

1163
00:37:44,150 --> 00:37:44,940
Then go.

1164
00:37:45,350 --> 00:37:46,290
You got the lines wrong.

1165
00:37:46,290 --> 00:37:47,510
Who got the lines wrong?

1166
00:37:47,510 --> 00:37:48,710
After you said that...

1167
00:37:48,710 --> 00:37:50,920
You got the lines wrong first.

1168
00:37:51,110 --> 00:37:52,030
You brought your personal life
into the show.

1169
00:37:52,030 --> 00:37:53,510
Cut!

1170
00:37:53,510 --> 00:37:54,760
What cut? What is cut?

1171
00:37:54,760 --> 00:37:55,800
What are you cutting for?

1172
00:37:55,800 --> 00:37:56,630
I haven't finished!

1173
00:37:56,630 --> 00:37:57,360
What do you want to say?

1174
00:37:57,360 --> 00:37:58,510
Am I wrong?

1175
00:37:58,510 --> 00:37:59,760
We are filming now, okay?

1176
00:37:59,760 --> 00:38:01,630
You wipe the table
and wash clothes at home.

1177
00:38:01,630 --> 00:38:02,800
Don't bring your personal life...

1178
00:38:02,800 --> 00:38:03,670
26 times.

1179
00:38:04,190 --> 00:38:06,190
We've shot this scene 26 times.

1180
00:38:06,440 --> 00:38:08,240
I told you they couldn't do this.

1181
00:38:08,440 --> 00:38:10,150
Mr. Zhou, you insisted that

1182
00:38:10,150 --> 00:38:11,950
actors hide behind their roles.

1183
00:38:12,360 --> 00:38:14,510
Well, they can't hide.

1184
00:38:14,510 --> 00:38:16,040
They keep showing their true selves.

1185
00:38:16,040 --> 00:38:17,100
They're too eager.

1186
00:38:17,400 --> 00:38:18,500
We're running out of time.

1187
00:38:18,500 --> 00:38:20,030
Let's think of another way.

1188
00:38:25,670 --> 00:38:28,030
But there's no one more suitable than them

1189
00:38:28,030 --> 00:38:28,960
in this village.

1190
00:38:28,960 --> 00:38:30,510
I fish for three days
and dry the nets for two days.

1191
00:38:30,510 --> 00:38:31,280
What do I do the rest of the time?

1192
00:38:31,280 --> 00:38:32,430
I have to clean up the house after you.

1193
00:38:32,430 --> 00:38:34,360
Why don't you mediate?

1194
00:38:35,110 --> 00:38:36,920
No use. I've been mediating for years.

1195
00:38:36,920 --> 00:38:38,180
I've never succeeded.

1196
00:38:39,920 --> 00:38:40,710
How about

1197
00:38:41,930 --> 00:38:42,790
I give it a try?

1198
00:38:44,100 --> 00:38:47,210
If I was wrong...

1199
00:38:47,230 --> 00:38:47,960
Shengzai...

1200
00:38:48,510 --> 00:38:49,040
Hey...

1201
00:38:49,450 --> 00:38:50,710
Are we shooting or not?

1202
00:38:52,910 --> 00:38:53,550
Yes!

1203
00:38:54,100 --> 00:38:54,700
Let's

1204
00:38:54,720 --> 00:38:56,200
take a short break.

1205
00:38:56,300 --> 00:38:57,470
Rest for 10 minutes.

1206
00:38:57,710 --> 00:38:58,150
Okay.

1207
00:38:58,280 --> 00:38:59,070
That's how we live our lives!

1208
00:38:59,070 --> 00:39:00,710
You bring your resentment to work,

1209
00:39:00,710 --> 00:39:01,110
huh?

1210
00:39:01,190 --> 00:39:02,710
Then you go to work! Go!

1211
00:39:02,710 --> 00:39:03,190
Work and support me.

1212
00:39:03,190 --> 00:39:03,710
How am I not working?

1213
00:39:03,710 --> 00:39:04,710
I work at home, don't I?

1214
00:39:04,710 --> 00:39:05,570
Work at home...

1215
00:39:06,900 --> 00:39:08,040
[Followers: 1553]

1216
00:39:10,070 --> 00:39:11,200
Where are you going?

1217
00:39:11,320 --> 00:39:11,980
Going home.

1218
00:39:12,710 --> 00:39:13,320
And then?

1219
00:39:13,420 --> 00:39:14,380
Going to work.

1220
00:39:15,190 --> 00:39:16,790
I've really got some talent.

1221
00:39:18,100 --> 00:39:19,160
What are you doing?

1222
00:39:20,020 --> 00:39:20,800
Please don't!

1223
00:39:20,800 --> 00:39:21,410
What are you doing?
